{"title": "Luck of the Far Realms", "pageid": 13981, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Luck_of_the_Far_Realms", "categories": ["Reactions", "Bugs", "Passive features", "Illithid Powers"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Luck_of_the_Far_Realms.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Luck_of_the_Far_Realms.webp/300px-Luck_of_the_Far_Realms.webp, /w/images/4/47/Luck_of_the_Far_Realms.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Luck_of_the_Far_Realms.webp/300px-Luck_of_the_Far_Realms.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/47/Luck_of_the_Far_Realms.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Luck of the Far Realms</b> is a passive feature/reaction and <a href=\"/wiki/Illithid_Power\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Illithid Power\">Illithid Power</a>. It allows a character to change a successful <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Roll</a> into a <a href=\"/wiki/Critical_Hit\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Critical Hit\">Critical Hit</a> once per long rest.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Once per <a href=\"/wiki/Long_Rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long Rest\">Long Rest</a>, you can change a successful <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Roll</a> against a foe into a <a href=\"/wiki/Critical_Hit\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Critical Hit\">Critical Hit</a>. \n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\"> Details </span></h3>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dt> Cost: </dt><dd> <span class=\"bg3wiki-info-blob\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/35px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/46px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Reactions\" title=\"Actions\">Reaction</a></span> </dd><dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Long rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a></dd>\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Full-illithid\" title=\"Full-illithid\">Full-illithid</a></li></ul>\n<p>Other ways to learn:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Unlock from the <a href=\"/wiki/Illithid_powers\" title=\"Illithid powers\">illithid power</a> skill tree with a <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Flayer_Parasite_Specimen\" title=\"Mind Flayer Parasite Specimen\">Mind Flayer Parasite Specimen</a> after obtaining the following:\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Favourable_Beginnings\" title=\"Favourable Beginnings\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Favourable_Beginnings_Icon.webp/25px-Favourable_Beginnings_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Favourable_Beginnings_Icon.webp/38px-Favourable_Beginnings_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Favourable_Beginnings_Icon.webp/50px-Favourable_Beginnings_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Favourable Beginnings\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Favourable_Beginnings_Icon.webp/25px-Favourable_Beginnings_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3e/Favourable_Beginnings_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Favourable_Beginnings\" title=\"Favourable Beginnings\">Favourable Beginnings</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Combines well with abilities which add numerous damage die to a single hit, such as <a href=\"/wiki/Sneak_Attack\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Sneak Attack\">Sneak Attack</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Divine_Smite\" title=\"Divine Smite\">Divine Smite</a>.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Due to the way this passive's reaction is coded<sup id=\"cite_ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>, it triggers on attacks that are not natural 20 rolls but are already critical hits due to <a href=\"/wiki/Critical_hit#Reducing_critical_threshold\" title=\"Critical hit\">Critical Hit Threshold Reductions</a>.</li>\n<li>Luck of the Far Realms is not reset when consuming a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber\" title=\"Potion of Angelic Slumber\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/62/POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/62/POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/62/POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber\" title=\"Potion of Angelic Slumber\">Potion of Angelic Slumber</a> nor when affected by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Divine_Intervention:_Opulent_Revival\" title=\"Divine Intervention: Opulent Revival\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f9/Divine_Intervention_Opulent_Revival_Icon.webp/20px-Divine_Intervention_Opulent_Revival_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f9/Divine_Intervention_Opulent_Revival_Icon.webp/30px-Divine_Intervention_Opulent_Revival_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f9/Divine_Intervention_Opulent_Revival_Icon.webp/40px-Divine_Intervention_Opulent_Revival_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Divine Intervention: Opulent Revival\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f9/Divine_Intervention_Opulent_Revival_Icon.webp/20px-Divine_Intervention_Opulent_Revival_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f9/Divine_Intervention_Opulent_Revival_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Divine_Intervention:_Opulent_Revival\" title=\"Divine Intervention: Opulent Revival\">Divine Intervention: Opulent Revival</a>.</li>\n<li>This reaction cannot be used while affected by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Starry_Form\" title=\"Starry Form\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cc/Starry_Form_Icon.webp/20px-Starry_Form_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cc/Starry_Form_Icon.webp/30px-Starry_Form_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cc/Starry_Form_Icon.webp/40px-Starry_Form_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Starry Form\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cc/Starry_Form_Icon.webp/20px-Starry_Form_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cc/Starry_Form_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Starry_Form\" title=\"Starry Form\">Starry Form</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">From the definition of <code>LuckOfTheFarRealmCheck()</code> in <code>Mods/Shared/Scripts/thoth/helpers/CommonConditionsDev.khn</code>:\n\n<details class=\"details--root wikicollapse\"><summary>Show code</summary>\n<pre>function LuckOfTheFarRealmCheck()\n    local notCrit = context.InterruptedRoll.NaturalRoll &lt; 20 and context.InterruptedRoll.NaturalRoll &gt; 1\n    local isHit = context.InterruptedRoll.Total &gt;= context.InterruptedRoll.Difficulty\n\n    return ConditionResult(notCrit and isHit)\nend\n</pre></details></span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195820\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.051 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.056 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1766/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 17837/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8066/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 1/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 745/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.016/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1056428/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   51.863      1 -total\n 87.86%   45.567      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n 19.70%   10.217      1 Template:InfoBlob\n 18.74%    9.718      1 Template:ResourceList\n 14.05%    7.289      4 Template:Icon_text\n 13.46%    6.983      1 Template:SmRarityItem\n 12.09%    6.269     14 Template:Trim\n 10.05%    5.211      1 Template:Item_icon\n  9.97%    5.173      2 Template:SmSAI\n  9.86%    5.116      3 Template:Icon_link\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:13981-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714195820 and revision id 362665. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}